# The api's settings for the observability plugin's telemetry screen and trace links. Given to the api whether the
# plugin is in use or not: a plugin's compose fragment never changes a core service's environment, and the plugin reads
# them only while it is installed.
# The screen's numbers are read from here, by the api, never by the browser.
Telemetry__PrometheusUrl=${PROMETHEUS_URL:-http://prometheus:9090}
Telemetry__JaegerUrl=${JAEGER_URL:-http://localhost:7171/jaeger}
Telemetry__TraceUrlTemplate=${TRACE_URL_TEMPLATE:-http://localhost:7171/jaeger/trace/{traceId}}
